# 2025-11-21 03:18:02.306703
+Build a responsive Calculator Mini-App with a clean interface that includes both Standard and Scientific modes using a toggle switch.
+
+Core Requirements
+
+A top-bar toggle to switch between Standard Mode and Scientific Mode.
+
+Smooth mode switching without resetting current input.
+
+Display area showing current input, past operation, and result.
+
+Standard Mode Functions
+
+Basic operations: +, −, ×, ÷
+
+%, x², √x, 1/x
+
+CE, C, Backspace
+
+Decimal input
+
+Keyboard support
+
+Scientific Mode Functions
+
+Everything from Standard mode
+
+sin, cos, tan (degree/radian toggle)
+
+log, ln, π, e
+
+xʸ, n!, mod
+
+Parentheses handling
+
+Operator precedence + accurate parsing

